  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>The above reaction has been studied at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The related data are given in the table below</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Reaction&nbsp;serial number</td>\t\t\t<td>Initial pressure of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><mi>kPa</mi></math>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Initial Pressure<br />\t\t\tof&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>kPa</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Initial rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>dp</mi></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>/</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>kPa</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>135</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>033</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>38</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>214</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>19</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>106</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>The order of the reaction with respect to NO is____</p>",
