  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The rate law for the reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>NO</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></math></p><p>The powers of the concentration terms m, n are the order with respect to hydrogen and nitric oxide respectively.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>135</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>033</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>38</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>214</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>106</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></mstyle></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>135</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>033</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the order with&nbsp;respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p></blockquote>",
